      "title": "Speedo’s new smart goggles module can track all four swim strokes",
      "link": "https://www.theverge.com/gadgets/985650/speedo-iq-vanquisher-goggles-module",
      "description": "Speedo is launching a removable smart module for its Vanquisher goggles that can analyze a swimmer's performance across all four swim strokes: freestyle, backstroke, breaststroke, and butterfly. The new Speedo iQ system uses swim-specific sensors to analyze head movement in the water, time breaths, and track distance per stroke. Unlike other smart goggles, such as [&#8230;]",
